{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "A Quick Coffee Break", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Work Woes", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le10ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dismayed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to cause someone to feel worried or upset", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was quite dismayed to hear the restaurant tales.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le10ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about a job situation.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "corporate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having to do with a corporation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The chef's restaurant was in a corporate setting.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le10ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "unrealistic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "when something is not sensible and appropriate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The editor in chief has set an unrealistic deadline.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le10ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "article", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a piece of writing that is included in a magazine or newspaper", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There was a number of articles to complete this week. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le10ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "obviously", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a way that is easy to see, understand, or recognize", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They have obviously found mistakes because we're so rushed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le10ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "rushed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to move or do something very quickly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The articles had mistakes because we're so rushed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le10ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Showing Interest, Enthusiasm and Sympathy", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use certain expressions to show interest at what someone is talking about. <br>There are expressions to show that you are enthusiastic about an idea.<br>There are also expressions to show sympathy at some sad news or someone's feelings.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The following table contain examples of expressions that show interest, enthusiasm, or surprise.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Interest</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Please do tell.<br> Then what happened? <br>Hey, what's going on?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Enthusiasm</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Wow! That's great. <br>Awesome. Let's do it.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Sympathy</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Oh, that's too bad. <br>Oh, that's unfortunate. <br>Oh, that must be difficult.<br> I'm sorry to hear that.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Had Better</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Ought to</span> for What is Advisable", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> to give advice.<br>  You can also use <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> to express a strong suggestion. <br>You can use the contraction <span class=\"italic\">'d better</span> when you speak.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Ought to</span> is used to give advice.<br> <span class=\"italic\"> You ought to have an honest conversation with your editor.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Might want to</span> is used for an advisable suggestion.<br> <span class=\"italic\"> You might want to get some rest to relieve your stress.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Had better</span> can be used as a strong recommendation or warning.<br><span class=\"italic\"> You'd better get more sleep.</span> ", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of a time when you were really stressed at school or at your job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 3 sentences on what caused the stress.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 3 sentences on what you did to relieve the stress.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give advice to your partner in English on how they can relieve stress.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write complete statements on what caused my stress.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write complete statements expressing advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I verbally share advice with my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le10ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le10ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<p><span class=\"italic\">Sally Davis &lt;sdavis@cambridgelife.com&gt; wrote:</span></p>\nHey, Vanessa. I was quite dismayed to hear your restaurant tales. I've realized now that when you're working in a corporate setting, mistakes must happen. The editor in chief has set an unrealistic deadline for the number of articles we have to complete this week."}, {"image": "engenn6le10ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "21500", "id": 2, "text": "After they are written, there are still a series of checks to be done and images to be attached. They have obviously found mistakes because we're so rushed. I have stopped taking lunch breaks and coffee breaks. I've also worked every night at home just to catch up, and I've sacrificed time with my family. I'm so stressed. What do you think I should do?"}, {"image": "engenn6le10ob06re2img06.jpg", "time": "44000", "id": 3, "text": "<p><span class=\"italic\">Vanessa Wright &lt;vanessa.rocks@mail.com&gt; wrote:</span></p>\n<p>Hi, Sally. I'm sorry to hear that you've been struggling under such demanding conditions.\nIt must be difficult for you, being so stressed. You'd better get more sleep!<br/></p>\n<p>I think you ought to have an honest conversation with your editor. It's important that they understand the efforts and sacrifices you have put forward for the sake of the publication.</p>"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le10ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le10ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can show interest, enthusiasm and sympathy.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can offer advice and solutions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you feel stressed at work or at school?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What advice can you give to someone who has demands or pressure at work or at school?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "There are so many pressures and demands at work!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nHow are things going with Sally's job?\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"corre